    {
      "reviewer_name": "Anonymous",
      "rating": null,
      "title": "BUY AS MANY AS YOU CAN",
      "review_text": "these sunglasses, full frame or half frame, I have been buying from Walmart since about 2005? Various name brands on the frames, but they are the same everytime. That is about 14 years of wearing the gray and brown/copper lens sunglasses, polarized, usually the smaller of the two lens sizes. Buy as many as you can, keep them in a clean safe place, they really do last a LONG time if you take care of them. My buddy gave me his old pair of his three figure polarized sunglasses , he was a charter fishing boat owner. I compared the two for clarity, glare, edge to edge clarity, etc. His sunglasses were definitely better BUT not by a whole lot!, No kdding. Did the comparison on a bright clear sunny day, cloudy day, same results.",
